(2796012, 389665, 55169, '<td valign="top">I like the title and the subject, wish the blue had been a baby blue.  For me its too much a primary color</td>', 'I like the title and the subject, wish the blue had been a baby blue.  For me its too much a primary color', '2006-09-04 12:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796019, 388430, 62671, '<td valign="top">These type of images fascinate me.  Optical illusions are fantastic.  Reflections of poofy white clouds at the top would add to the illusion.  But nature never cooperates that well.  I like the orange of the floaters match the orange of the sky.  Very nice!</td>', 'These type of images fascinate me.  Optical illusions are fantastic.  Reflections of poofy white clouds at the top would add to the illusion.  But nature never cooperates that well.  I like the orange of the floaters match the orange of the sky.  Very nice!', '2006-09-04 12:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796020, 390090, 55169, '<td valign="top">I like the intention.  For me, I would have liked to have seen the lips match the eye shade and the eyelashes to be less matted.  Very critical, I know, but my impression.  I like the offset of the face to the scarf</td>', 'I like the intention.  For me, I would have liked to have seen the lips match the eye shade and the eyelashes to be less matted.  Very critical, I know, but my impression.  I like the offset of the face to the scarf', '2006-09-04 12:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796022, 390508, 55169, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the white space</td>', 'Nice use of the white space', '2006-09-04 12:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796026, 390310, 55169, '<td valign="top">Where is this?  I like it</td>', 'Where is this?  I like it', '2006-09-04 12:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796028, 389854, 55169, '<td valign="top">I like the image, shading/highlights and haziness.  Would like to see a bit more color</td>', 'I like the image, shading/highlights and haziness.  Would like to see a bit more color', '2006-09-04 12:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796030, 390551, 55169, '<td valign="top">Nice color, but a little hazy in my opinion</td>', 'Nice color, but a little hazy in my opinion', '2006-09-04 12:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796038, 389424, 55169, '<td valign="top">I like the photo.  I think I''d like to the see the girl in focus more than the doll.  Nice job</td>', 'I like the photo.  I think I''d like to the see the girl in focus more than the doll.  Nice job', '2006-09-04 12:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796086, 388811, 62671, '<td valign="top">I love old brick settings.  This is unique with the opening at the top allowing light to come thru the ivy.  The large floral on the dress matches the shape of the plant dropping down the hole.  The leading lines in the image draw your eye to where her hands meet the brick.  Which suggest she is possibly tied up.  The look on her face adds to the idea she is there against her will.  A slight change in hand position could have altered that perception.  I don''t care for many lower perspective with models as its usually looking straight up the nose.  But I think you pulled it off well here.</td>', 'I love old brick settings.  This is unique with the opening at the top allowing light to come thru the ivy.  The large floral on the dress matches the shape of the plant dropping down the hole.  The leading lines in the image draw your eye to where her hands meet the brick.  Which suggest she is possibly tied up.  The look on her face adds to the idea she is there against her will.  A slight change in hand position could have altered that perception.  I don''t care for many lower perspective with models as its usually looking straight up the nose.  But I think you pulled it off well here.', '2006-09-04 12:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796096, 390136, 62671, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Macro!  I want a macro lens so badly!  The Colors here fit the challenge very well.  Love how the wings are so transparent.</td>', 'Beautiful Macro!  I want a macro lens so badly!  The Colors here fit the challenge very well.  Love how the wings are so transparent.', '2006-09-04 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796133, 390364, 59148, '<td valign="top">OK due to the amount of challenges I was not going to comment on any in this challenge but man this one is too funny..nice</td>', 'OK due to the amount of challenges I was not going to comment on any in this challenge but man this one is too funny..nice', '2006-09-04 12:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796134, 390535, 62671, '<td valign="top">Lovely eyes!  Her eyes have the same color as the dress she is wearing.  The lighting on her face is perfect as it has just enough shadow to define her features but no harsh shadows.   I can see the shape of the reflector in her eyes.   The only thing I could find for improvement is the hot spot on the flowers she is holding, but that is minor and doesn''t grab the attention. Her skin is beautifully soft and perfect.  A fabulous portrait!</td>', 'Lovely eyes!  Her eyes have the same color as the dress she is wearing.  The lighting on her face is perfect as it has just enough shadow to define her features but no harsh shadows.   I can see the shape of the reflector in her eyes.   The only thing I could find for improvement is the hot spot on the flowers she is holding, but that is minor and doesn''t grab the attention. Her skin is beautifully soft and perfect.  A fabulous portrait!', '2006-09-04 12:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796137, 390513, 59148, '<td valign="top">Nice composition wish the focus was just slightly sharper not much just slightly on maybe the top thread bobbin</td>', 'Nice composition wish the focus was just slightly sharper not much just slightly on maybe the top thread bobbin', '2006-09-04 12:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
