(2796256, 390411, 45672, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Those erotion ruts are awesome.  There is something wrong with the blue sky though.  It looks like maybe you had used a selective color mask in PS and you adjusted the cyan but not the blue.  I don''t see a real solid connection with pastels, but I suppose the grass near the stream is pastel enough, so I won''t dock you.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Those erotion ruts are awesome.  There is something wrong with the blue sky though.  It looks like maybe you had used a selective color mask in PS and you adjusted the cyan but not the blue.  I don''t see a real solid connection with pastels, but I suppose the grass near the stream is pastel enough, so I won''t dock you.  Keep up the good work.', '2006-09-04 12:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796260, 390492, 45672, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Good set up.  I might like to see just a little more DOF so that the first pile of shadow is in focus, but this is still a good shot.</td>', 'Great idea.  Good set up.  I might like to see just a little more DOF so that the first pile of shadow is in focus, but this is still a good shot.', '2006-09-04 12:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796265, 390537, 45672, '<td valign="top">Nice softness in this image.  This one is the best I''ve seen so far.  The lighting is excellent.  Having those clouds in the sky makes all the difference.  Very very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice softness in this image.  This one is the best I''ve seen so far.  The lighting is excellent.  Having those clouds in the sky makes all the difference.  Very very nice shot.', '2006-09-04 12:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796271, 388434, 45672, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and great composition.  It''s a little blury though.  If the light bulb and the base were tack sharp this would be a great image.  Good idea though.</td>', 'Cool idea and great composition.  It''s a little blury though.  If the light bulb and the base were tack sharp this would be a great image.  Good idea though.', '2006-09-04 12:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796273, 390389, 45672, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  This one is one of the best ones in this challenge so far.  Nice lighting.  The composition is perfect and the border helps too.</td>', 'Very nice!  This one is one of the best ones in this challenge so far.  Nice lighting.  The composition is perfect and the border helps too.', '2006-09-04 12:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
