(2797953, 390533, 62671, '<td valign="top">Colors that we call ''clashing'' are beautiful when nature mixes them.  Is this from the butterfly bush?  This is very lovely.  One thing that catches my attention are the hot spots on the petals.  A diffused light might have been better.</td>', 'Colors that we call ''clashing'' are beautiful when nature mixes them.  Is this from the butterfly bush?  This is very lovely.  One thing that catches my attention are the hot spots on the petals.  A diffused light might have been better.', '2006-09-04 20:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
