(2797995, 390387, 62671, '<td valign="top">This image has good dof and color.  Flowers are best shot in diffused light instead of harsh sunlight.  Though this one isn''t bad because you don''t have a lot of deep shadows.  Your composition is also good.</td>', 'This image has good dof and color.  Flowers are best shot in diffused light instead of harsh sunlight.  Though this one isn''t bad because you don''t have a lot of deep shadows.  Your composition is also good.', '2006-09-04 20:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
