(2798038, 389705, 62671, '<td valign="top">The fuzzy hairy surface these are on is very unapealing.  Would have been best on a flat hard surface.  It was a good attempt at a macro but didn''t quite make it.  Its out of focus and pixelated. I like the concept and the colors.</td>', 'The fuzzy hairy surface these are on is very unapealing.  Would have been best on a flat hard surface.  It was a good attempt at a macro but didn''t quite make it.  Its out of focus and pixelated. I like the concept and the colors.', '2006-09-04 21:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
