(2798052, 390508, 62671, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  A high key watercolored effect.   It''s also unusual to have the empty space below.   I like the unusual experimentation.  I''m rating this high.</td>', 'This is interesting.  A high key watercolored effect.   It''s also unusual to have the empty space below.   I like the unusual experimentation.  I''m rating this high.', '2006-09-04 21:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
