(2798063, 389178, 62671, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image.  I would have liked to see more of the guys legs.  It would have shown more of his movement against the direction of the rain.  I see the building is the ''pastel'' color your wanting to show but your area of focus is on the guy who is not wearing pastel.  The lighting is sufficently grey for the image''s story but I don''t quite feel it fits the theme of the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice image.  I would have liked to see more of the guys legs.  It would have shown more of his movement against the direction of the rain.  I see the building is the ''pastel'' color your wanting to show but your area of focus is on the guy who is not wearing pastel.  The lighting is sufficently grey for the image''s story but I don''t quite feel it fits the theme of the challenge.', '2006-09-04 21:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798073, 388182, 62671, '<td valign="top">Great use of the rule of 3rds.  I had a recent picture request for an image just like this.  This is a very useable shot.  The fawns eyes are looking right at you and ears perked up and at alert.  The black eyes and nose pop right out of this image.   I think it needs a little more color.  I wonder where mom is.  I have been ''hunting'' for a buck in this similar pose.</td>', 'Great use of the rule of 3rds.  I had a recent picture request for an image just like this.  This is a very useable shot.  The fawns eyes are looking right at you and ears perked up and at alert.  The black eyes and nose pop right out of this image.   I think it needs a little more color.  I wonder where mom is.  I have been ''hunting'' for a buck in this similar pose.', '2006-09-04 21:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798076, 390325, 62671, '<td valign="top">The clarity on the buildings is very good.  If only that sky had some color and texture!</td>', 'The clarity on the buildings is very good.  If only that sky had some color and texture!', '2006-09-04 21:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
