(2798318, 390123, 62671, '<td valign="top">Im not crazy about the color tones.  I would have altered it in photoshop to boost the blues/pinks better.  Looks like the ISO might have been a bit high as you  have some noise in the dark areas.  I might have flipped this image to show the rays coming downward as we would expect them to be even though they may not have been.   I like the shape of the cloud.  Looks like a hand holding the sun if it had been flipped.</td>', 'Im not crazy about the color tones.  I would have altered it in photoshop to boost the blues/pinks better.  Looks like the ISO might have been a bit high as you  have some noise in the dark areas.  I might have flipped this image to show the rays coming downward as we would expect them to be even though they may not have been.   I like the shape of the cloud.  Looks like a hand holding the sun if it had been flipped.', '2006-09-04 22:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798325, 390198, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, lovely colours and composition.</td>', 'Very pretty, lovely colours and composition.', '2006-09-04 22:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
