(2798342, 390389, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and the composition and the close crop. I wish the pastels were is focus as well.</td>', 'Love the colours and the composition and the close crop. I wish the pastels were is focus as well.', '2006-09-04 22:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
