(2798349, 390012, 45672, '<td valign="top">This one is very well done.  It''s missing something in my opinion though.  Maybe a softer look.  I''m afraid that the sharpness is too high.  The reflection in the window is superb.  The verticle lines are great and the rose fits well.  I feel like the upper right corner of the photograph needs something too.  Overall, a very strong image!  Way to go!</td>', 'This one is very well done.  It''s missing something in my opinion though.  Maybe a softer look.  I''m afraid that the sharpness is too high.  The reflection in the window is superb.  The verticle lines are great and the rose fits well.  I feel like the upper right corner of the photograph needs something too.  Overall, a very strong image!  Way to go!', '2006-09-04 22:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798350, 390037, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great pastel colours although they seem a little fake to me. Beautiful scene though!</td>', 'Great pastel colours although they seem a little fake to me. Beautiful scene though!', '2006-09-04 22:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
