(2798373, 389872, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but I think your composition could be stronger. My eyes immediately go to the bare spot on the left and the out of focus flowers in the front. Perhaps a better crop would help this.</td>', 'Nice colours but I think your composition could be stronger. My eyes immediately go to the bare spot on the left and the out of focus flowers in the front. Perhaps a better crop would help this.', '2006-09-04 22:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
