(2798378, 390367, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting! I have a bouquet of these and was considering taking pictures of them for this challenge but thought they weren''t pastel enough. But you made it work. Excellent clarity here.</td>', 'Interesting! I have a bouquet of these and was considering taking pictures of them for this challenge but thought they weren''t pastel enough. But you made it work. Excellent clarity here.', '2006-09-04 22:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
