(2798385, 389883, 62671, '<td valign="top">This is difficult to achieve.  I really don''t care for the distracting background.  I know shots like this can''t be helped.   Seems the dark tones are a tad noisy.  I applaud you on the difficulty of this shot but its  not really working for me,  sorry.</td>', 'This is difficult to achieve.  I really don''t care for the distracting background.  I know shots like this can''t be helped.   Seems the dark tones are a tad noisy.  I applaud you on the difficulty of this shot but its  not really working for me,  sorry.', '2006-09-04 22:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
