(2798429, 390548, 62671, '<td valign="top">I love the pastel background against the backlit grass fuzzies.  The two blue things hanging down on top really grab the attention.  They really need removed somehow.</td>', 'I love the pastel background against the backlit grass fuzzies.  The two blue things hanging down on top really grab the attention.  They really need removed somehow.', '2006-09-04 23:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798469, 390508, 58728, '<td valign="top">brilliant composition.  VEry original.  I like it.  :)  9</td>', 'brilliant composition.  VEry original.  I like it.  :)  9', '2006-09-04 23:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798472, 390364, 62671, '<td valign="top">Your concept is good here.   We are unindated with colors all around us in our products.  It is the most important thing in advertising to use the color as well as the shape of their containers to ''brand'' the product to be easily recognised by sight without having to look at any label.   Beauty products and bath products use pastels for a very valid reasons.  Pastels are feminine, soft, and luxurious.  It appeals to the majority of the persons pushing the carts.   I think the bottles need to be full for a product shot.  What black surface are you using?  Paper?  I would have cleaned up the blacks to remove specks.  I also use felt or velvet for black since paper reflects more light and shows up specks more.  Sorry for the long post.</td>', 'Your concept is good here.   We are unindated with colors all around us in our products.  It is the most important thing in advertising to use the color as well as the shape of their containers to ''brand'' the product to be easily recognised by sight without having to look at any label.   Beauty products and bath products use pastels for a very valid reasons.  Pastels are feminine, soft, and luxurious.  It appeals to the majority of the persons pushing the carts.   I think the bottles need to be full for a product shot.  What black surface are you using?  Paper?  I would have cleaned up the blacks to remove specks.  I also use felt or velvet for black since paper reflects more light and shows up specks more.  Sorry for the long post.', '2006-09-04 23:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798480, 388434, 58728, '<td valign="top">i love this. It''s beautiful.  10.</td>', 'i love this. It''s beautiful.  10.', '2006-09-04 23:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798492, 390432, 62671, '<td valign="top">The color tones are unusual here.  You dont see to many seafoam green colored backgrounds.  Its fresh.  The flower doesn''t look quite right.  The bottom of the forward petal doesnt look like it belongs.  The edge looks to sharp like its been pasted into place.  It also seems to have a different amount of focus than the sepals.  I think you have also lost detail and texture in the petals that should be there.</td>', 'The color tones are unusual here.  You dont see to many seafoam green colored backgrounds.  Its fresh.  The flower doesn''t look quite right.  The bottom of the forward petal doesnt look like it belongs.  The edge looks to sharp like its been pasted into place.  It also seems to have a different amount of focus than the sepals.  I think you have also lost detail and texture in the petals that should be there.', '2006-09-04 23:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798496, 390077, 52130, '<td valign="top">that''s so random, but I love it</td>', 'that''s so random, but I love it', '2006-09-04 23:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798498, 389406, 62671, '<td valign="top">I love the background and the expression on her face!   I don''t care for the legs of the stool showing.  This would have been perfect on a swing with her shoes on the ground below her or possibly a white wicker chair.  Either way she needs her shoes.</td>', 'I love the background and the expression on her face!   I don''t care for the legs of the stool showing.  This would have been perfect on a swing with her shoes on the ground below her or possibly a white wicker chair.  Either way she needs her shoes.', '2006-09-04 23:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798502, 390383, 52130, '<td valign="top">wow! that''s cra-zay!</td>', 'wow! that''s cra-zay!', '2006-09-04 23:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798505, 388218, 62671, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely!  I love the flow of the blue petals.  I can almost see it super imposed on a twirling dancer as her flowing skirt.  The background is mildly distracting but the angle of the branch works.  I like the softening effect you used on the edges.</td>', 'This is really lovely!  I love the flow of the blue petals.  I can almost see it super imposed on a twirling dancer as her flowing skirt.  The background is mildly distracting but the angle of the branch works.  I like the softening effect you used on the edges.', '2006-09-04 23:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798508, 388620, 62671, '<td valign="top">A beautiful rose with good contrast against the dark greens.</td>', 'A beautiful rose with good contrast against the dark greens.', '2006-09-04 23:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798515, 390188, 62671, '<td valign="top">I love the color, texture, and especially the red being ''rubbed'' off the kiss me candy.</td>', 'I love the color, texture, and especially the red being ''rubbed'' off the kiss me candy.', '2006-09-04 23:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798520, 389605, 62671, '<td valign="top">Thats an odd structure and equally odd color tones.</td>', 'Thats an odd structure and equally odd color tones.', '2006-09-04 23:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798531, 390529, 62671, '<td valign="top">Lots of turquoise.  What a vulnerable position. Her skin is perfectly smooth and soft looking.  Not my taste in images but the image was done very well.</td>', 'Lots of turquoise.  What a vulnerable position. Her skin is perfectly smooth and soft looking.  Not my taste in images but the image was done very well.', '2006-09-04 23:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798542, 387589, 62671, '<td valign="top">These dogs are intense in personality which makes up for their soft color tones!  This is a beautiful pet portrait.  There is a bit of noise in the image. (Im not about to attempt to spell the dogs breed)  LOL</td>', 'These dogs are intense in personality which makes up for their soft color tones!  This is a beautiful pet portrait.  There is a bit of noise in the image. (Im not about to attempt to spell the dogs breed)  LOL', '2006-09-04 23:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798555, 390534, 62671, '<td valign="top">Legos! Wow this is amazing to look at.  All the boxes and squares and all the people they represent.  Just amazes me that so many people can occupy such small spaces.  I love the boat!  The fact its red makes it pop and it  breaks up the lines.  The water line is very straight too!</td>', 'Legos! Wow this is amazing to look at.  All the boxes and squares and all the people they represent.  Just amazes me that so many people can occupy such small spaces.  I love the boat!  The fact its red makes it pop and it  breaks up the lines.  The water line is very straight too!', '2006-09-04 23:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798559, 390502, 62671, '<td valign="top">I remember candy beads!  I like the use of selective color here.  The childs expression is fantastic too.</td>', 'I remember candy beads!  I like the use of selective color here.  The childs expression is fantastic too.', '2006-09-04 23:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798580, 388538, 62671, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and colors.  The one thing I dont care for here is the edge of the field is leading your eye nowhere.  Possibly to the blue cloud but I think that line is not needed.  Its breaking up the flow of the watercolor sky.  The horizon line is in the right spot.</td>', 'Beautiful sky and colors.  The one thing I dont care for here is the edge of the field is leading your eye nowhere.  Possibly to the blue cloud but I think that line is not needed.  Its breaking up the flow of the watercolor sky.  The horizon line is in the right spot.', '2006-09-04 23:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798681, 389267, 62671, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image.  I like the shadows of the birds on the sand and the foot prints at an angle.</td>', 'This is an interesting image.  I like the shadows of the birds on the sand and the foot prints at an angle.', '2006-09-05 00:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
