(2798810, 389854, 62671, '<td valign="top">Is that a nose piercing or a pixel error?  Either way I would clone it out. <br/>I like the skin tones and smooth texture. Love the eyes!</td>', 'Is that a nose piercing or a pixel error?  Either way I would clone it out. I like the skin tones and smooth texture. Love the eyes!', '2006-09-05 01:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
