(2798849, 388724, 62671, '<td valign="top">Sundogs are hard to get the colors to come out right.  Your blues are almost showing up.  the clouds on the left are a bit forboding.  To me it looks like a profile of a skull... very interesting.</td>', 'Sundogs are hard to get the colors to come out right.  Your blues are almost showing up.  the clouds on the left are a bit forboding.  To me it looks like a profile of a skull... very interesting.', '2006-09-05 01:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
