(2807036, 390077, 36988, '<td valign="top">This image is lovely and very fitting of the challenge. My only thought is that although you''ve mastered this style very well, it is becoming somewhat predicatble and safe and knowing your talent, I would love to see you start expanding yourself a bit more. Too much of a good thing... :) 8</td>', 'This image is lovely and very fitting of the challenge. My only thought is that although you''ve mastered this style very well, it is becoming somewhat predicatble and safe and knowing your talent, I would love to see you start expanding yourself a bit more. Too much of a good thing... :) 8', '2006-09-06 20:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807040, 388818, 36988, '<td valign="top">A very good take on the challenge and you hit it dead on. My only thought is that although the colors are right, it''s just a bit too bold to project the feel of softness that pastel really implies. Nice job! 7</td>', 'A very good take on the challenge and you hit it dead on. My only thought is that although the colors are right, it''s just a bit too bold to project the feel of softness that pastel really implies. Nice job! 7', '2006-09-06 20:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807044, 387126, 36988, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. 7</td>', 'Very, very nice. 7', '2006-09-06 20:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807212, 388617, 36988, '<td valign="top">Ok, so let me start by saying that you get a 10 and in my opinion deserve the blue ribbon without a close second. Instead of taking a pastel color and making it your background to meet the challenge, you chose a colour that compliments your look and editing choices perfetcly. My eye dances from eye to flower to face and back again and the green of your eye seems glued to the green core of the flower while the soft colour of your face ties to the yellows and pinks remarkably well. Even the choice to look up as if you''re prompting the viewer to get involved is perfectly fitting. Congratulations on taking the theme and incorporating it into a truly remarkable piece of work which I feel is one of the best casual portraits I''ve seen in a long, long time... I am so impressed. 10</td>', 'Ok, so let me start by saying that you get a 10 and in my opinion deserve the blue ribbon without a close second. Instead of taking a pastel color and making it your background to meet the challenge, you chose a colour that compliments your look and editing choices perfetcly. My eye dances from eye to flower to face and back again and the green of your eye seems glued to the green core of the flower while the soft colour of your face ties to the yellows and pinks remarkably well. Even the choice to look up as if you''re prompting the viewer to get involved is perfectly fitting. Congratulations on taking the theme and incorporating it into a truly remarkable piece of work which I feel is one of the best casual portraits I''ve seen in a long, long time... I am so impressed. 10', '2006-09-06 21:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807219, 390513, 36988, '<td valign="top">To me this is a ribbon winner. Very soft and has the feel of pastelly ellegance. Very well done. 9</td>', 'To me this is a ribbon winner. Very soft and has the feel of pastelly ellegance. Very well done. 9', '2006-09-06 21:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807232, 388997, 36988, '<td valign="top">An excellent representation of the challenge theme and very well executed. Nice job!</td>', 'An excellent representation of the challenge theme and very well executed. Nice job!', '2006-09-06 21:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
