(2817331, 390306, 55746, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this is a winner.  This is beautiful on so many levels.  Perfect pastels in the pup and the blanket.  Clean crisp focus.  Excellent exposure - no loss of detail.  Perhaps the only thing I would have liked to see is a bit more depth of field so that the dog''s nose and mouth are as crisp as his eyes, however, I am drawn to his eyes because the nose is slightly less crisp so perhaps it isn''t a bad thing.  Very well done.</td>', 'In my opinion this is a winner.  This is beautiful on so many levels.  Perfect pastels in the pup and the blanket.  Clean crisp focus.  Excellent exposure - no loss of detail.  Perhaps the only thing I would have liked to see is a bit more depth of field so that the dog''s nose and mouth are as crisp as his eyes, however, I am drawn to his eyes because the nose is slightly less crisp so perhaps it isn''t a bad thing.  Very well done.', '2006-09-09 09:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817338, 388807, 55746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject.  I feel like her skin has lost a lot of detail - it feels too soft to me. I would have liked to see both eyes in focus.</td>', 'Beautiful subject.  I feel like her skin has lost a lot of detail - it feels too soft to me. I would have liked to see both eyes in focus.', '2006-09-09 09:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817339, 390203, 55746, '<td valign="top">I like your idea but feel like the subject is floating or has been cut out and placed on a white backing.</td>', 'I like your idea but feel like the subject is floating or has been cut out and placed on a white backing.', '2006-09-09 09:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817341, 390399, 55746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject but I am distracted by the buildings in the background and the smoke pulls me away from the girl.</td>', 'Beautiful subject but I am distracted by the buildings in the background and the smoke pulls me away from the girl.', '2006-09-09 09:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817350, 388691, 55746, '<td valign="top">I love your idea but feel that the baby''s ear is in focus by its face is not.</td>', 'I love your idea but feel that the baby''s ear is in focus by its face is not.', '2006-09-09 09:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817360, 387936, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and good exposure.  The only thing I would change is to not cut off the model''s right arm.</td>', 'Nice angle and good exposure.  The only thing I would change is to not cut off the model''s right arm.', '2006-09-09 09:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
