(2817363, 388793, 55746, '<td valign="top">I like the idea to have a soft photo and the exposure is beautiful but there is so very little depth of field - I think ig needs more, without it the green leaves become what my eyes are drawn to.</td>', 'I like the idea to have a soft photo and the exposure is beautiful but there is so very little depth of field - I think ig needs more, without it the green leaves become what my eyes are drawn to.', '2006-09-09 09:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
