(2817380, 388890, 55746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful garden but I find that the backpack on the girl is distracting.  Perhaps not having the girl in the photo would have made the photo more pleasing.</td>', 'Beautiful garden but I find that the backpack on the girl is distracting.  Perhaps not having the girl in the photo would have made the photo more pleasing.', '2006-09-09 09:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817778, 390154, 57519, '<td valign="top">I normally like to look at gorgeous girl pics. I feel the colors are a bit oversaturated, and I also find this entry in the pastel challenge is a bit of a stretch. BUT! Natasha is darn pretty!</td>', 'I normally like to look at gorgeous girl pics. I feel the colors are a bit oversaturated, and I also find this entry in the pastel challenge is a bit of a stretch. BUT! Natasha is darn pretty!', '2006-09-09 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817785, 390432, 57519, '<td valign="top">I think your pic is a bit oversharpened. Pretty flower though.</td>', 'I think your pic is a bit oversharpened. Pretty flower though.', '2006-09-09 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817789, 389870, 57519, '<td valign="top">That thing way over there? Weird title. COOL sky!</td>', 'That thing way over there? Weird title. COOL sky!', '2006-09-09 14:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817794, 388890, 57519, '<td valign="top">First you get to see all the colors, you feel WOW! Then the eyes are led to the grassy area, and you "get stuck" on the girl. She takes something away from what you''re trying to say. I''m willing to bet you''d have preferred her to not be in the pic. Good try. You have the eye!</td>', 'First you get to see all the colors, you feel WOW! Then the eyes are led to the grassy area, and you "get stuck" on the girl. She takes something away from what you''re trying to say. I''m willing to bet you''d have preferred her to not be in the pic. Good try. You have the eye!', '2006-09-09 14:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817795, 390185, 57519, '<td valign="top">I think you have a ribbon winner here!</td>', 'I think you have a ribbon winner here!', '2006-09-09 14:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817796, 390525, 57519, '<td valign="top">Very interesting mixture of opposites here.</td>', 'Very interesting mixture of opposites here.', '2006-09-09 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817799, 389904, 57519, '<td valign="top">I get to feel the pic is a bit too busy, lacking a specific subject. I also have a hard time seeing how it fits the challenge.</td>', 'I get to feel the pic is a bit too busy, lacking a specific subject. I also have a hard time seeing how it fits the challenge.', '2006-09-09 14:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817800, 390091, 57519, '<td valign="top">Certainly pastel with good DOF and focus, but I don''t get any feeling from it.</td>', 'Certainly pastel with good DOF and focus, but I don''t get any feeling from it.', '2006-09-09 14:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817808, 390306, 57519, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time trying to figure out why I don''t really like this pic. I totally get the title, and it does fit the challenge. I think maybe it''s because this looks like an energetic dog and it should be doing something. I dunno, running after a ball or a frisbe or something. It''s almost as if someone is holding it down for the pic.</td>', 'I''m having a hard time trying to figure out why I don''t really like this pic. I totally get the title, and it does fit the challenge. I think maybe it''s because this looks like an energetic dog and it should be doing something. I dunno, running after a ball or a frisbe or something. It''s almost as if someone is holding it down for the pic.', '2006-09-09 14:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2817823, 388434, 57519, '<td valign="top">I dunno, really. It''s a blue ceilling...Never seen that before. It''s an out of focus light. It''s a wall in need of repairs. It''s a blown out pair of windows (overexposed). I really can''t give this a high score.<br/>Reasons: Out of focus light, bad composition with no subject, overexposed windows.<br/>I don''t want to be mean, but I know you can do better.</td>', 'I dunno, really. It''s a blue ceilling...Never seen that before. It''s an out of focus light. It''s a wall in need of repairs. It''s a blown out pair of windows (overexposed). I really can''t give this a high score.Reasons: Out of focus light, bad composition with no subject, overexposed windows.I don''t want to be mean, but I know you can do better.', '2006-09-09 14:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
