(2820218, 390534, 1031, '<td valign="top">The bright spots at the top pull my eye up and away from the boat -- I think I''d have cropped a bit lower or darkened them up a bit; though I like that the left one almost mirrors the shape of the sail. A nice assortment of background textures making up the negative space.</td>', 'The bright spots at the top pull my eye up and away from the boat -- I think I''d have cropped a bit lower or darkened them up a bit; though I like that the left one almost mirrors the shape of the sail. A nice assortment of background textures making up the negative space.', '2006-09-10 13:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
