(2823107, 389957, 30049, '<td valign="top">Personally, (you asked for feedback in forum thread), I think it''s a little busy and that busy-ness (word?) gives it a snapshot kinda feel.  I''m also thinking that the foreground is almost lightened a bit too much - seems unnatural given the location of the sun.  Could be this monitor at work, but the foreground looks like it could use a little more contrast.  All of the above is JMO of course.  ;^)</td>', 'Personally, (you asked for feedback in forum thread), I think it''s a little busy and that busy-ness (word?) gives it a snapshot kinda feel.  I''m also thinking that the foreground is almost lightened a bit too much - seems unnatural given the location of the sun.  Could be this monitor at work, but the foreground looks like it could use a little more contrast.  All of the above is JMO of course.  ;^)', '2006-09-11 10:14:38.000000', NULL, 0),
