(2823141, 389957, 58728, '<td valign="top">I thought this photo was amazing.  I gave it a 10 during voting.  I like everything about this picture.  The composition is fantastic, and I love that the sun is there.  Great job IMO.  ;)</td>', 'I thought this photo was amazing.  I gave it a 10 during voting.  I like everything about this picture.  The composition is fantastic, and I love that the sun is there.  Great job IMO.  ;)', '2006-09-11 10:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823145, 390427, 50695, '<td valign="top">how right you were about the chalk, but this was one of MY ribbon-winners (a fat lot of good that''ll do you). It fulfills the challenge with pastel yellow and green, creating a washed-out pastel effect that perfectly fits the mood of this piece, a washed-out urban setting, washed out of hope, washed out of commerce, washed out of notice. But you show us a man whose story must surely be as interesting as any on the tv or movie screen. 10</td>', 'how right you were about the chalk, but this was one of MY ribbon-winners (a fat lot of good that''ll do you). It fulfills the challenge with pastel yellow and green, creating a washed-out pastel effect that perfectly fits the mood of this piece, a washed-out urban setting, washed out of hope, washed out of commerce, washed out of notice. But you show us a man whose story must surely be as interesting as any on the tv or movie screen. 10', '2006-09-11 10:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823150, 390154, 3942, '<td valign="top">Hi Gary! You know, my English is not as good as it should be for taking part in DPC. Nevertheless I hope, that you do not misunderstand my comment! 1st: The model is beautiful, her hair is outstanding. 2nd: Your photo is nice, and I would be very proud of it, if it would be mine ;-). But you are playing in an other league and I don''t think "wow" here (as by viewing at most of your other portraits!). IMHO the composition could be better and somehow I miss the "kiwistyle". Due to your viewpoint (position) her legs are a bit too accentuated and so they are competing against her beautiful face. In addition the black couch doesn''t fit to a beauty-shot like this.</td>', 'Hi Gary! You know, my English is not as good as it should be for taking part in DPC. Nevertheless I hope, that you do not misunderstand my comment! 1st: The model is beautiful, her hair is outstanding. 2nd: Your photo is nice, and I would be very proud of it, if it would be mine ;-). But you are playing in an other league and I don''t think "wow" here (as by viewing at most of your other portraits!). IMHO the composition could be better and somehow I miss the "kiwistyle". Due to your viewpoint (position) her legs are a bit too accentuated and so they are competing against her beautiful face. In addition the black couch doesn''t fit to a beauty-shot like this.', '2006-09-11 10:23:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823168, 390525, 50695, '<td valign="top">I was your solo 10, and this was one of my ribbon winners. You used a common piece of tulle to such great dramatic effect, simply by juxtaposing it against rusted barbed wire. Amazing how that juxtaposition transforms the fabric, forces it to <i>represent</i> something, and at the same time forces the barbed wire to <i>represent</i> something. That is what the artist/photographer does: impose meanings on the world around her.</td>', 'I was your solo 10, and this was one of my ribbon winners. You used a common piece of tulle to such great dramatic effect, simply by juxtaposing it against rusted barbed wire. Amazing how that juxtaposition transforms the fabric, forces it to represent something, and at the same time forces the barbed wire to represent something. That is what the artist/photographer does: impose meanings on the world around her.', '2006-09-11 10:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823169, 387899, 43714, '<td valign="top">You are so good Sandy, love your photos, Way to go!!!!</td>', 'You are so good Sandy, love your photos, Way to go!!!!', '2006-09-11 10:27:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823181, 388434, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is so painterly, such an elegant composition, such a transformation of your surroundings. I love the yellow that seems to only appear when activated by sunlight, as opposed to the stolid blue where you would least expect it: on the ceiling, a sad imitation of the sky. The light bulb sun emits no light, just feeds off what comes through the window. This photo, so poignant, is one of my ribbon winners and perhaps the blue ribbon (fortunately, I don''t have to make that decision). 10</td>', 'this is so painterly, such an elegant composition, such a transformation of your surroundings. I love the yellow that seems to only appear when activated by sunlight, as opposed to the stolid blue where you would least expect it: on the ceiling, a sad imitation of the sky. The light bulb sun emits no light, just feeds off what comes through the window. This photo, so poignant, is one of my ribbon winners and perhaps the blue ribbon (fortunately, I don''t have to make that decision). 10', '2006-09-11 10:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823239, 387899, 34763, '<td valign="top">WOW! So very expected. You are a winner in everything ... and your photos are great too!!</td>', 'WOW! So very expected. You are a winner in everything ... and your photos are great too!!', '2006-09-11 10:45:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823250, 389836, 50695, '<td valign="top">Simple enough, but very well executed. The softness is tangible. :) 9</td>', 'Simple enough, but very well executed. The softness is tangible. :) 9', '2006-09-11 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823255, 388724, 50695, '<td valign="top">the obscurantism of the clouds and the bright colors of the rainbow combine to give a sense of pastel. The composition is a thrilling, glorious mess of abstraction. 9</td>', 'the obscurantism of the clouds and the bright colors of the rainbow combine to give a sense of pastel. The composition is a thrilling, glorious mess of abstraction. 9', '2006-09-11 10:54:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823260, 389267, 50695, '<td valign="top">your processing has achieved a pastel effect, even if it is in earthtones. The unusually high angle sets this apart from Cutter''s wonderful photo. This is disorienting without needing to be quite as kinetic as his. 9</td>', 'your processing has achieved a pastel effect, even if it is in earthtones. The unusually high angle sets this apart from Cutter''s wonderful photo. This is disorienting without needing to be quite as kinetic as his. 9', '2006-09-11 10:56:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823263, 390202, 49652, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites in the challenge.  Definitely underrated.</td>', 'This was one of my favorites in the challenge.  Definitely underrated.', '2006-09-11 10:57:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823264, 388434, 62187, '<td valign="top">Your photo was a great - ''Out of the Box'' submission. I like to think we all came here to DPC to see more then flowers, teddy bears, and crayons. I guess not...too bad. Keep up the good work...I appreciate it. };&gt;)</td>', 'Your photo was a great - ''Out of the Box'' submission. I like to think we all came here to DPC to see more then flowers, teddy bears, and crayons. I guess not...too bad. Keep up the good work...I appreciate it. };>)', '2006-09-11 10:57:30.000000', NULL, 0),
