(2823294, 390478, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think it''s wonderful to use pastel colors to create an effect not usually associated with pastels, but that is way beyond the proto-neanderthal understanding of the average dpc voter. I personally gave you an 8.</td>', 'I think it''s wonderful to use pastel colors to create an effect not usually associated with pastels, but that is way beyond the proto-neanderthal understanding of the average dpc voter. I personally gave you an 8.', '2006-09-11 11:07:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823319, 388691, 52115, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challemnge. It definitely is a soft pastel, with good composition and appealing subject. I like it better than the third place bird. Maybe experiment with the technique the that one used to alter just the background darker or a different color tone.<br/> <br/>I agree if the ear wasn''t in focus it would be even better. Maybe a fog machine or some digital fog, if it were aloud, or spot blurring would easily adjust that aspect.<br/></td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challemnge. It definitely is a soft pastel, with good composition and appealing subject. I like it better than the third place bird. Maybe experiment with the technique the that one used to alter just the background darker or a different color tone. I agree if the ear wasn''t in focus it would be even better. Maybe a fog machine or some digital fog, if it were aloud, or spot blurring would easily adjust that aspect.', '2006-09-11 11:14:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823325, 387899, 37961, '<td valign="top">OMG OMG!!! you are doing great Sandy. Beautiful pastel entry. Congrats!!</td>', 'OMG OMG!!! you are doing great Sandy. Beautiful pastel entry. Congrats!!', '2006-09-11 11:17:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823329, 390090, 37961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Manny. Wow.</td>', 'Beautiful Manny. Wow.', '2006-09-11 11:18:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823333, 390472, 37961, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I thought this one was great, should''ve scored higher.</td>', 'Hmm, I thought this one was great, should''ve scored higher.', '2006-09-11 11:20:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823335, 390328, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7, which is a very high score from me on a landscape, since landscapes usually bore me, even when they''re pretty. This one''s got some good energy from the crashing wave, the reflections and the crazy clouds.</td>', 'I gave this a 7, which is a very high score from me on a landscape, since landscapes usually bore me, even when they''re pretty. This one''s got some good energy from the crashing wave, the reflections and the crazy clouds.', '2006-09-11 11:20:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823336, 390041, 37961, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely. Doesn''t get much more pastel than this!</td>', 'This is just lovely. Doesn''t get much more pastel than this!', '2006-09-11 11:21:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823338, 390090, 64568, '<td valign="top">Stunning model and stunning shot, well deserved win ;-)</td>', 'Stunning model and stunning shot, well deserved win ;-)', '2006-09-11 11:21:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823342, 389842, 64568, '<td valign="top">great shot, well done on you ribbon ;-)</td>', 'great shot, well done on you ribbon ;-)', '2006-09-11 11:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823347, 390391, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice use of DOF to point our attention to the pastel elements: the eyes and nose. It also somehow conveys the almost desperate neediness of a kitten. I gave this a 7, and I want to know your secret for getting a 6 out of DPC with such a creative picture.</td>', 'nice use of DOF to point our attention to the pastel elements: the eyes and nose. It also somehow conveys the almost desperate neediness of a kitten. I gave this a 7, and I want to know your secret for getting a 6 out of DPC with such a creative picture.', '2006-09-11 11:22:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823348, 387899, 64568, '<td valign="top">well done Sandy, a beautiful shot, great colouring ;-)</td>', 'well done Sandy, a beautiful shot, great colouring ;-)', '2006-09-11 11:22:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823351, 389673, 50695, '<td valign="top">very cool composition. oddly flat considering how much perspective is involved here (I mean that as a good thing!). I gave it a 7.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-11 10:24:05.</i></td>', 'very cool composition. oddly flat considering how much perspective is involved here (I mean that as a good thing!). I gave it a 7.', '2006-09-11 11:23:35.000000', '2006-09-11 11:24:05.000000', 0),
(2823362, 389904, 50695, '<td valign="top">I see there is some pastel here, particularly in the sky. When I voted I didn''t see much pastel and gave you a 7 simply for creating such a wonderful photograph. It''s just amazing how effectively the busy composition draws the eye to the bicyclist at the center.</td>', 'I see there is some pastel here, particularly in the sky. When I voted I didn''t see much pastel and gave you a 7 simply for creating such a wonderful photograph. It''s just amazing how effectively the busy composition draws the eye to the bicyclist at the center.', '2006-09-11 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823366, 390203, 52115, '<td valign="top">Maybe to make it more realistic, the knife could have been straightened up, to a more vertical position by putting it into some white foam or a small hidden C-clamp. That would hold it in a natural cutting angle. The paper detracts. Great title. <br/> <br/>I''d like to see a retake with a dramatic, suspensfull, black background and beans made more pastel. Then you would have to add a small spotlight on the knife, if you wanted the handle to show. Pastel would bring out the blood and knife more.</td>', 'Maybe to make it more realistic, the knife could have been straightened up, to a more vertical position by putting it into some white foam or a small hidden C-clamp. That would hold it in a natural cutting angle. The paper detracts. Great title.  I''d like to see a retake with a dramatic, suspensfull, black background and beans made more pastel. Then you would have to add a small spotlight on the knife, if you wanted the handle to show. Pastel would bring out the blood and knife more.', '2006-09-11 11:26:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823437, 389957, 52449, '<td valign="top">Not a bad composition. It''s the exposure that concerns me. It''s not quite a silhouette and that makes it harder to bring out much detail. Also, this photo does not scream "pastel" for the particular challenge.</td>', 'Not a bad composition. It''s the exposure that concerns me. It''s not quite a silhouette and that makes it harder to bring out much detail. Also, this photo does not scream "pastel" for the particular challenge.', '2006-09-11 11:52:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823438, 389052, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awww, I really feel this should have placed much higher.  It is a fantastic photo!</td>', 'Awww, I really feel this should have placed much higher.  It is a fantastic photo!', '2006-09-11 11:53:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823454, 387899, 51538, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  Nice exotic subject and quality phtoography work well together ;-)</td>', 'Congratulations.  Nice exotic subject and quality phtoography work well together ;-)', '2006-09-11 11:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823457, 389957, 7743, '<td valign="top">You were probably trying not to blow out the sun, however the foreground seems to need a touch more light to bring out the detail of the fence, and possibley enhance the colour a bit.</td>', 'You were probably trying not to blow out the sun, however the foreground seems to need a touch more light to bring out the detail of the fence, and possibley enhance the colour a bit.', '2006-09-11 12:01:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823458, 389662, 51538, '<td valign="top">Well, I would not have guessed this to be a Lesley...  Nice work!</td>', 'Well, I would not have guessed this to be a Lesley...  Nice work!', '2006-09-11 12:01:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823463, 390389, 54778, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the placement and I adore the composition!</td>', 'Congrats on the placement and I adore the composition!', '2006-09-11 12:02:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823515, 390481, 59470, '<td valign="top">Yo!  Top 20 ~ Congrats Bri!  Great set up on this one. The colors are really vivid.</td>', 'Yo!  Top 20 ~ Congrats Bri!  Great set up on this one. The colors are really vivid.', '2006-09-11 12:23:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823520, 389957, 15242, '<td valign="top">I love the composition.  I would have maybe waited until the sun was just under the horizon though.  I''m guessing you didn''t have a tripod handy when shooting this though (thus F7 and ISO 200).  A tripod and a much slower shutter would have been my first choice if I were shooting this.  <br/>On my monitor the colors seem a little muted, maybe because it''s slightly underexposed?  I''m not a PS pro so I can''t offer much advice on how to punch them up a little.<br/>I''m not sure if it was intentional, but the photo looks soft.  the soft focus does work nice here, but the trees kind of have a blotchy look to them.  It makes it look more like a painting, kind of a nice Monet feel though.  I would have scored it a 6. <br/> <br/>Why the 5.4?  I''d guess it was a combo of the soft focus/painting feel which is not always popular here and the muted colors.</td>', 'I love the composition.  I would have maybe waited until the sun was just under the horizon though.  I''m guessing you didn''t have a tripod handy when shooting this though (thus F7 and ISO 200).  A tripod and a much slower shutter would have been my first choice if I were shooting this.  On my monitor the colors seem a little muted, maybe because it''s slightly underexposed?  I''m not a PS pro so I can''t offer much advice on how to punch them up a little.I''m not sure if it was intentional, but the photo looks soft.  the soft focus does work nice here, but the trees kind of have a blotchy look to them.  It makes it look more like a painting, kind of a nice Monet feel though.  I would have scored it a 6.  Why the 5.4?  I''d guess it was a combo of the soft focus/painting feel which is not always popular here and the muted colors.', '2006-09-11 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823530, 390328, 16230, '<td valign="top">Great work Shannon. It should have placed much higher than it did.<br/> <br/>BTW, I love your name. My daughter has one just like it. :D<br/></td>', 'Great work Shannon. It should have placed much higher than it did. BTW, I love your name. My daughter has one just like it. :D', '2006-09-11 12:27:20.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2823545, 390472, 19708, '<td valign="top">This is priceless !!!<br/>One of those perfect moments with the tongue sticking out.</td>', 'This is priceless !!!One of those perfect moments with the tongue sticking out.', '2006-09-11 12:30:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823548, 390391, 18349, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> nice use of DOF to point our attention to the pastel elements: the eyes and nose. It also somehow conveys the almost desperate neediness of a kitten. I gave this a 7, and I want to know your secret for getting a 6 out of DPC with such a creative picture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks...no secret, really...I figured this one for a 5.1 or 5.2 because it''s a kitten.  I used to think I had DPC voters figured out, but that is far from the truth. I have no idea what they want from challenge to challenge.  I just take pictures I like now, and if it fits, all the better.  :)  The biggest challenge with this picture was getting Sugar to sit still for a few moments while I focused.  Now THAT was a challenge!! :)</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: nice use of DOF to point our attention to the pastel elements: the eyes and nose. It also somehow conveys the almost desperate neediness of a kitten. I gave this a 7, and I want to know your secret for getting a 6 out of DPC with such a creative picture.   Thanks...no secret, really...I figured this one for a 5.1 or 5.2 because it''s a kitten.  I used to think I had DPC voters figured out, but that is far from the truth. I have no idea what they want from challenge to challenge.  I just take pictures I like now, and if it fits, all the better.  :)  The biggest challenge with this picture was getting Sugar to sit still for a few moments while I focused.  Now THAT was a challenge!! :)', '2006-09-11 12:31:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823550, 389920, 31005, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to vote but beautiful image and great job finishing in the top 10!!  Congrats...</td>', 'I didn''t get to vote but beautiful image and great job finishing in the top 10!!  Congrats...', '2006-09-11 12:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823571, 390090, 28532, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful!!!  Congrats on the blue ribbon!!</td>', 'Very beautiful!!!  Congrats on the blue ribbon!!', '2006-09-11 12:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823578, 387899, 42567, '<td valign="top">Sandy, what a wonderful picture!!  Congratulations on your 3rd place!!!</td>', 'Sandy, what a wonderful picture!!  Congratulations on your 3rd place!!!', '2006-09-11 12:37:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823580, 387899, 28532, '<td valign="top">Stunning!!!  The color is just beautiful!  Congrats on the yellow!!</td>', 'Stunning!!!  The color is just beautiful!  Congrats on the yellow!!', '2006-09-11 12:38:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823594, 389842, 24454, '<td valign="top">What an awesome photo!  Simple, but so striking and appealing!  All of your work is so beautiful!  Congratulations on your first of I''m sure many ribbons!!</td>', 'What an awesome photo!  Simple, but so striking and appealing!  All of your work is so beautiful!  Congratulations on your first of I''m sure many ribbons!!', '2006-09-11 12:40:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823595, 389842, 28532, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorite shots when voting and now I get to look at it all week!  Congrats on second!!!</td>', 'This was one of my favorite shots when voting and now I get to look at it all week!  Congrats on second!!!', '2006-09-11 12:40:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823633, 390090, 5792, '<td valign="top">Congrats on another tremendous image. I agree, this student will grace the screens of DPC more in the future. You have the ability to bring the most from your subjects. We always marvel at your ability to display the human form in all its wonder and accurately capture its place within our enivironment which is planet Earth.</td>', 'Congrats on another tremendous image. I agree, this student will grace the screens of DPC more in the future. You have the ability to bring the most from your subjects. We always marvel at your ability to display the human form in all its wonder and accurately capture its place within our enivironment which is planet Earth.', '2006-09-11 12:51:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823645, 390174, 5112, '<td valign="top">Yeah!  This is so beautiful.  Congratulations.<br/> <br/>He, he, I tried adding you to my favourites list, but you were there already :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-11 11:54:28.</i></td>', 'Yeah!  This is so beautiful.  Congratulations. He, he, I tried adding you to my favourites list, but you were there already :)', '2006-09-11 12:53:44.000000', '2006-09-11 12:54:28.000000', 0),
(2823650, 390090, 24454, '<td valign="top">2 comments you got during the challenge say it all:<br/> <br/>"Freaking Awesome"!!!!     DITTO!!!<br/> <br/>And I love the one that said it could pass for a Librodo :)  Tee hee.  Indeed it does!   Very much up to your killer standard!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', '2 comments you got during the challenge say it all: "Freaking Awesome"!!!!     DITTO!!! And I love the one that said it could pass for a Librodo :)  Tee hee.  Indeed it does!   Very much up to your killer standard!!!! ', '2006-09-11 12:54:21.000000', NULL, 0),
