(2823748, 387899, 31133, '<td valign="top">Sandy!! Way to go! I agree 100% with PhantomEWO - this is expected and it´s wonderful. Sooo glad you entered. The colors are gorgeous. I love the sneaky looking expression on the bird. This is just beautiful.</td>', 'Sandy!! Way to go! I agree 100% with PhantomEWO - this is expected and it´s wonderful. Sooo glad you entered. The colors are gorgeous. I love the sneaky looking expression on the bird. This is just beautiful.', '2006-09-11 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823751, 387899, 57882, '<td valign="top">The beauty of this shot, besides the obvious beauty of the bird, is that it looks like a photo you would produce - soft, great color and aesthetically pleasing.  Very good work with this!</td>', 'The beauty of this shot, besides the obvious beauty of the bird, is that it looks like a photo you would produce - soft, great color and aesthetically pleasing.  Very good work with this!', '2006-09-11 13:21:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823761, 390519, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work, Karen!! I´m off travelling right now and just peeked in to see this gorgeous image - the thumbnail drew me right in. I wish I had time to vote because I would´ve tried to help lift this a bit towards an even higher place that it made. Very nice!</td>', 'Beautiful work, Karen!! I´m off travelling right now and just peeked in to see this gorgeous image - the thumbnail drew me right in. I wish I had time to vote because I would´ve tried to help lift this a bit towards an even higher place that it made. Very nice!', '2006-09-11 13:24:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823791, 389957, 37818, '<td valign="top">It is a lovely image..I think the voters are getting tougher these days..But IMHO there is not a pastel colour here at all, I think that is what lowered your score. And for me, meeting the challenge is top priority. <br/>FWIW I didnt think tuborgs shot should have placed so high. Again, it is a great shot, but that does not transcend meeting the challenge, for me.</td>', 'It is a lovely image..I think the voters are getting tougher these days..But IMHO there is not a pastel colour here at all, I think that is what lowered your score. And for me, meeting the challenge is top priority. FWIW I didnt think tuborgs shot should have placed so high. Again, it is a great shot, but that does not transcend meeting the challenge, for me.', '2006-09-11 13:31:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823802, 390472, 35545, '<td valign="top">This should be in the Gary Larson challenge.</td>', 'This should be in the Gary Larson challenge.', '2006-09-11 13:33:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823815, 390411, 50641, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lighting on that mountain.  The grass below sort of approaches pastel.  This shot is so nice that you still got a 5+ despite the dark colors!!   Given the colorblindness, you are very courageous for taking a stab at this challenge.  Way to be in the game ;-)</td>', 'Gorgeous lighting on that mountain.  The grass below sort of approaches pastel.  This shot is so nice that you still got a 5+ despite the dark colors!!   Given the colorblindness, you are very courageous for taking a stab at this challenge.  Way to be in the game ;-)', '2006-09-11 13:38:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2823904, 387126, 53701, '<td valign="top">I like this one and so did many others. Good job!</td>', 'I like this one and so did many others. Good job!', '2006-09-11 14:10:52.000000', NULL, 0),
