(2824040, 389836, 32378, '<td valign="top">Wow, really was hoping this would better, seems anything different just doesn''t score well here, which is too bad.  I gave you a 10, loved the colors and the fact that you made it abstract thus different from what is normally seen here.</td>', 'Wow, really was hoping this would better, seems anything different just doesn''t score well here, which is too bad.  I gave you a 10, loved the colors and the fact that you made it abstract thus different from what is normally seen here.', '2006-09-11 14:45:55.000000', NULL, 0),
