(2827540, 387899, 3936, '<td valign="top">My very first entry wa DQ''ed because when I cropped it, it left thin line on one side.  (In those days frames were not allowed.)  And it really stung.<br/> <br/>As one who has never won a ribbon, I know this really had to hurt. Take heart in the fact that you did create a beautiful photo that is much admired.  And who knows, perhaps this technique will be allowed in the future.</td>', 'My very first entry wa DQ''ed because when I cropped it, it left thin line on one side.  (In those days frames were not allowed.)  And it really stung. As one who has never won a ribbon, I know this really had to hurt. Take heart in the fact that you did create a beautiful photo that is much admired.  And who knows, perhaps this technique will be allowed in the future.', '2006-09-12 12:34:53.000000', NULL, 0),
