(2828534, 387899, 1066, '<td valign="top">Still a great shot and one for your portfolio..which is worth a hundred ribbons :-D<br/> <br/>Actually...could you go into greater detail how you processed this photo..perhaps showing us the original and then taking us through the steps.<br/> <br/>The reason is your result is truly great and I would like to learn something.<br/> <br/>I would ask you to email me all that but I think lots of people might learn something too.<br/> <br/>Thanks!</td>', 'Still a great shot and one for your portfolio..which is worth a hundred ribbons :-D Actually...could you go into greater detail how you processed this photo..perhaps showing us the original and then taking us through the steps. The reason is your result is truly great and I would like to learn something. I would ask you to email me all that but I think lots of people might learn something too. Thanks!', '2006-09-12 18:26:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2828626, 390406, 23680, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to publicly thank everyone for their votes and comments.  (Wow, look no 1''s or 2''s!)  I''m pretty excited and shocked at this one but at the same time not happy about getting my ribbon this way.</td>', 'I just wanted to publicly thank everyone for their votes and comments.  (Wow, look no 1''s or 2''s!)  I''m pretty excited and shocked at this one but at the same time not happy about getting my ribbon this way.', '2006-09-12 18:59:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2828682, 390406, 30861, '<td valign="top">I really DO wish you''d stop giving away "our" lighting secrets, mom... Your description made me laugh. Go check out some of my setups sometime to see why :-)<br/> <br/>We should form a "Team NO Studio" or something!<br/> <br/>Congrats on a lovely flower and a well-deserved ribbon.</td>', 'I really DO wish you''d stop giving away "our" lighting secrets, mom... Your description made me laugh. Go check out some of my setups sometime to see why :-) We should form a "Team NO Studio" or something! Congrats on a lovely flower and a well-deserved ribbon.', '2006-09-12 19:21:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2829312, 389920, 42567, '<td valign="top">HEY Congratulations!!  What a wonderful picture.  The 5th place looks great on your profile page!  Keep up the great work.</td>', 'HEY Congratulations!!  What a wonderful picture.  The 5th place looks great on your profile page!  Keep up the great work.', '2006-09-12 22:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2829327, 387899, 22734, '<td valign="top">This truly hurts! Chalk it up to experience. But what a lovely image and I am still at a loss as to why it got DQued. This is why sometime back I pressed hard on this issue: that is you you work hard to process an image and then the whole effort falls victim to a dq. Regardless, you have my condolence for your loss. The image is strong enough to stand on its own as a fine study.<br/> <br/>Now, is the dq because of the obliteration of the backgound to pure black? If I understand you, you produced two versions from the raw. One was darkened and then laid over the first to erased all other info except the bird. No reason for a dq unless all background info was made black.</td>', 'This truly hurts! Chalk it up to experience. But what a lovely image and I am still at a loss as to why it got DQued. This is why sometime back I pressed hard on this issue: that is you you work hard to process an image and then the whole effort falls victim to a dq. Regardless, you have my condolence for your loss. The image is strong enough to stand on its own as a fine study. Now, is the dq because of the obliteration of the backgound to pure black? If I understand you, you produced two versions from the raw. One was darkened and then laid over the first to erased all other info except the bird. No reason for a dq unless all background info was made black.', '2006-09-12 23:02:03.000000', NULL, 0),
