(2830040, 387899, 30608, '<td valign="top">Sandy, It''s good to see so many of your DPC friends offering their condolences for the loss of your ribbon. The Site Counsel might be able to take away your well deserved ribbon, but they can not take away the prize capture you shot. Like Daniel said, the image is strong enough to stand on it''s own. <br/> <br/>You stand in the same group as one of the top photographers in DPC. There will be a lot more ribbons coming your way. Keep up your excellent work. Everybody here knows you are a winner and that you produce award winning photographs.</td>', 'Sandy, It''s good to see so many of your DPC friends offering their condolences for the loss of your ribbon. The Site Counsel might be able to take away your well deserved ribbon, but they can not take away the prize capture you shot. Like Daniel said, the image is strong enough to stand on it''s own.  You stand in the same group as one of the top photographers in DPC. There will be a lot more ribbons coming your way. Keep up your excellent work. Everybody here knows you are a winner and that you produce award winning photographs.', '2006-09-13 01:55:52.000000', NULL, 0),
