(2905097, 390328, 66060, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot, I especially love:<br/> <br/>- Water action<br/>- Reflection of sky in puddle<br/>- Hightlights<br/> <br/>Not like:<br/> <br/>- Darkness of right rock<br/>- Noise / Grainyness (sp?)<br/> <br/>Also depends what style you want to go for but I think smart dodge/burn would be helpful (whilst retaining the calmness of the image). Anyway, enough from me, fav''d it :)</td>', 'Incredible shot, I especially love: - Water action- Reflection of sky in puddle- Hightlights Not like: - Darkness of right rock- Noise / Grainyness (sp?) Also depends what style you want to go for but I think smart dodge/burn would be helpful (whilst retaining the calmness of the image). Anyway, enough from me, fav''d it :)', '2006-10-07 05:47:36.000000', NULL, 0),
